  "releaseNotes": "Updated all peSHIr.* dependencies to latest versions, except for upgrade from xunit to xunit.v3 in unit test projects.\n\n      Added InnermostException() and InnermostMessage() to peSHIr.SystemHelper to get to the bottom of a stack of inner/aggregate exceptions easily.\n      Added NotSupported() to peSHIr.SystemHelper to easily create NotSupportedException instances from inner exceptions or message strings.\n      Added various FormatBytes() overloads to peSHIr.Text.FormatHelpers to format a sequence of byte values, next to existing FormatBytes(TTS) overloads for formatting numbers of bytes into a file or memory size.\n      Added CompressCharacters() and CompressSpaces() to peSHIr.Text.FormatHelpers.\n      Added EnsureRooted() to peSHIr.IO.PathHelpers.",
